Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Title,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,1:49:45.21,1:49:47.21,Viator - Viet,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:00.02,Title,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:58.02,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The warp threads are the flow of time.
Comment: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They are dyed by the sky's\N color as the seasons change.
Comment: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The woof threads are one's calling.
Comment: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They help one stand firm and sways their heart.
Comment: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Iorph continue to weave Hibiol
Comment: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,throughout their long lives, for hundreds of years.
Comment: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:01:48.64,0:01:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia!
Comment: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Comment: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you start playing around,\N you won't finish work!
Comment: 0,0:01:57.17,0:01:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get here too, Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump on over!
Comment: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I can't do it.
Comment: 0,0:02:07.55,0:02:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward!
Comment: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia,
Comment: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't need to accompany that tomboy.
Comment: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim...
Comment: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You really... don't have to.
Comment: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They, who continue weaving \N away from any humans, are called
Comment: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the Clan of Partings.
Comment: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Madam Racine?
Comment: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Comment: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You better do it next time, Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Comment: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Comment: 0,0:03:04.32,0:03:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't handle the cloths like that!
Comment: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Comment: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so drenched.
Comment: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, did you get some good flowers?
Comment: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. We can get some bright colors with them.
Comment: 0,0:03:18.15,0:03:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Comment: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye...
Comment: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The threads...
Comment: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Comment: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm alone.
Comment: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone? Even though I am here?
Comment: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder, that's not what I...
Comment: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a crybaby.
Comment: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why we are\N  called the Clan of Partings?
Comment: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We, who live long lives with \N     little change in appearance,
Comment: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,are creatures from tales of old
Comment: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,for those who are not.
Comment: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Until a couple of hundreds of years ago,
Comment: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you can find such beings everywhere.
Comment: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A clan that has wings like a bird's.
Comment: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Flowers that sing before the break of dawn.
Comment: 0,0:04:36.39,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant fish pull themselves in waterways.
Comment: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Comment: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,all of them have parted ways from this world.
Comment: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly why
Comment: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we continue to weave Hibiol cloth.
Comment: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be alone as long as you're here.
Comment: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories that encompass the years past
Comment: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is remembered by the Hibiol.
Comment: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even those who were unable to say goodbye
Comment: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,cry with you inside the Hibiol.
Comment: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're crying with me?
Comment: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But if ever you leave Iorph,
Comment: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and have encounters from the outside world,
Comment: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you must never love anyone.
Comment: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you love someone, you'll truly be alone.
Comment: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be alone even if I meet others?
Comment: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the destiny that we,
Comment: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the Clan of Partings, was given.
Comment: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Comment: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Maquia.
Comment: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget today's worth of Hibiol.
Comment: 0,0:05:58.70,0:05:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It bloomed.
Comment: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia?
Comment: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Renato?!
Comment: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Mezarte has...
Comment: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the Elder's place!
Comment: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder!
Comment: 0,0:08:25.41,0:08:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder!
Comment: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder...
Comment: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder!
Comment: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Renato are armed!
Comment: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Hibiol!
Comment: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Comment: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the rumors say.
Comment: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only kids here.
Comment: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you into this kind of thing?
Comment: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Comment: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Izor.
Comment: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who leads this village?
Comment: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Comment: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the first time I laid eyes on one.
Comment: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You might look like a young girl,
Comment: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've heard you're actually                                  a 400 year old monster.
Comment: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our daily life consists of weaving cloth and days,
Comment: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,repeated for many times.
Comment: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not have time to\N  interact with people like you.
Comment: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one to decide that.
Comment: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the King's order:
Comment: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to come with us \N to the Mezarte Royal Palace.
Comment: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come near Madam Racine!
Comment: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The women!
Comment: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture the women!
Comment: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You may cut down those who resist!
Comment: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy got the Red Eye Disease...!
Comment: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him!
Comment: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, prioritize Iorph!
Comment: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out! Let me ou...
Comment: 0,0:11:29.53,0:11:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Comment: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}NOOOOOOO!{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, get here too, Maquia!{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jump on over!{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A... baby?
Comment: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A wine made of tears
Comment: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,tastes great because there's a hint of salt.
Comment: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Maquia from the Elder's place, was it?
Comment: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to buy Hibiol, but got stuck here.
Comment: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a settlement for vagrants,\N but looks like thieves took them out.
Comment: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And this one's just born.
Comment: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is a hassle being a mother.
Comment: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tried to protect her baby at the cost of her life.
Comment: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if we let him be, they'll be reunited soon.
Comment: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His Hibiol will end here.
Comment: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A teensy-tiny cut you can't call a cloth will be made.
Comment: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's better than staying here alone.
Comment: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he truly alone?
Comment: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So... powerful...
Comment: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Comment: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop that.
Comment: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna take him?
Comment: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no toy at all...
Comment: 0,0:15:57.84,0:15:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a toy.
Comment: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my...
Comment: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hibiol.
Comment: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Comment: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A loner meets another loner.
Comment: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling cold?
Comment: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You smell weird.
Comment: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells like the sun.
Comment: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.2\fs100.001\b1\blur49.999\t(0,2300,0.08,\blur0)\c&H4476B9&\t(0,2300,1.5,\c&HFFFFFF&)\fad(1000,0)\pos(1368,307)}Maquia:
