Comment: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.25\b1\blur79.999\t(0,2300,0.07,\blur0)\c&H4476B9&\t(0,2300,1.5,\c&HFFFFFF&)\fad(1000,0)\pos(1363.999,491)}Flower Blooms
Comment: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Comment: 0,0:16:46.67,0:16:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Comment: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait!
Comment: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Lang! Deol!
Comment: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you slacking around?
Comment: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here!
Comment: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait!
Comment: 0,0:16:57.17,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't wait!
Comment: 0,0:16:57.49,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why you...
Comment: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, this playful brat.
Comment: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Onora?
Comment: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The boobs...
Comment: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The boobs...
Comment: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The boobs...
Comment: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where they are!
Comment: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen here,
Comment: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,a child raising a child is totally\N impossible, don't you think?
Comment: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your child?
Comment: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't tell an Iorphian's age \N based on her looks, right?
Comment: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it yours?
Comment: 0,0:17:56.45,0:17:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lang, Deol.
Comment: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm fifteen...
Comment: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This child... is not.
Comment: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know his age.
Comment: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that baby's name?
Comment: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Comment: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How weird.
Comment: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird girl.
Comment: 0,0:18:23.05,0:18:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird baby!
Comment: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia!
Comment: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia...
Comment: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a girl's name.
Comment: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that baby male?
Comment: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,T-then...
Comment: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Reiri--
Comment: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri...
Comment: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel.
Comment: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Comment: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Comment: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Comment: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a child of my relatives. And she weaves cloths.
Comment: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an unused weaving \N machine at the back of the shop.
Comment: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use that.
Comment: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there.
Comment: 0,0:19:17.23,0:19:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's from Iorph.
Comment: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no match to you, Darel.
Comment: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope...
Comment: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Iorph cloths can fetch a high price.
Comment: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't expose the identity
Comment: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,of such a precious source of income.
Comment: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Comment: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, she's bare as bones
Comment: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and an Iorphian girl on top of that.
Comment: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Comment: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what'll happen from now on.
Comment: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether she's here or not.
Comment: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, today's share.
Comment: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you as always.
Comment: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cheese taste different than the rest after all.
Comment: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! I'll count on you next week as well!
Comment: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Different on second taste!
Comment: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And on the week after that!
Comment: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at my age,
Comment: 0,0:20:16.77,0:20:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,raising kids alone is so hectic.
Comment: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand that?
Comment: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband, you see,
Comment: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,got killed by a Renato that\N contracted the Red Eye Disease.
Comment: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Comment: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Again with the "I don't know."
Comment: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what a mother is like.
Comment: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because... I...
Comment: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't have one.
Comment: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like this!
Comment: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He walked!
Comment: 0,0:22:02.31,0:22:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Comment: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're becoming more like a mama now!
Comment: 0,0:22:23.56,0:22:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Me... a mama?
Comment: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't a mother this unreliable!
Comment: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you already finished cleaning the goat shed?
Comment: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's Mom!
Comment: 0,0:22:35.07,0:22:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Deol!
Comment: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mom.
Comment: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Comment: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, out with your butts.
Comment: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Comment: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Comment: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Try saying "Mama".
Comment: 0,0:22:56.30,0:22:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A lie! That one's a lie!
Comment: 0,0:22:58.84,0:22:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Comment: 0,0:23:01.19,0:23:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel, what did you just say?
Comment: 0,0:23:06.69,0:23:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time.
Comment: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it again.
Comment: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Renato has contracted the Red Eye Disease.
Comment: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been euthanized quickly.
Comment: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Its remains have been isolated, cremated,
Comment: 0,0:23:27.19,0:23:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and buried underground.
Comment: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a total of five still alive.
Comment: 0,0:23:31.75,0:23:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, how could this be!
Comment: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mezarte was able to conquer neighboring countries
Comment: 0,0:23:38.33,0:23:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,because of these ancient monsters, the Renato.
Comment: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So if they die off, the balance will crumble eventually.
Comment: 0,0:23:46.55,0:23:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For Mezarte to maintain it's authority,
Comment: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we need an existence beyond human\N comprehension to replace the Renato.
Comment: 0,0:23:53.43,0:23:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,T-that's right.
Comment: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have acquired it.
Comment: 0,0:23:57.13,0:23:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood of the chosen!
Comment: 0,0:23:59.13,0:24:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Izor, how's that woman faring?
Comment: 0,0:24:02.29,0:24:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Iorph girl that will be Prince Hazel's bride.
Comment: 0,0:24:07.75,0:24:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why is it this way?
Comment: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your kind has wings,
Comment: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,yet why can't you fly away from here?
Comment: 0,0:24:22.45,0:24:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Weakling.
Comment: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all dying.
Comment: 0,0:24:27.86,0:24:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all dying while your bodies burn
Comment: 0,0:24:31.22,0:24:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,from all the pent-up emotions
Comment: 0,0:24:32.58,0:24:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you've left burning in your heart.
Comment: 0,0:24:35.27,0:24:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia, you have been called by the King.
Comment: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a bit more time.
Comment: 0,0:24:42.57,0:24:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia, why are you always here?
Comment: 0,0:24:47.14,0:24:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it looks like the Hibiol tower.
Comment: 0,0:24:50.80,0:24:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Comment: 0,0:25:08.34,0:25:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Comment: 0,0:25:09.38,0:25:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it worded properly?
Comment: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. "Onora, get well soon!"
Comment: 0,0:25:15.79,0:25:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,From where I was born,
Comment: 0,0:25:18.30,0:25:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we use cloths instead of \N characters to express our feelings.
Comment: 0,0:25:21.91,0:25:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,From where Mama was born?
Comment: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was I born?
Comment: 0,0:25:26.84,0:25:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita's mother said it.
Comment: 0,0:25:28.79,0:25:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's different from everyone else.
Comment: 0,0:25:33.14,0:25:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The place you were born in
Comment: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,has these things talking on their stomachs...
Comment: 0,0:25:38.14,0:25:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,wiggly insects.
Comment: 0,0:25:39.80,0:25:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're heeeeere!
Comment: 0,0:25:40.80,0:25:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggle wiggle wiggle wiggle!
Comment: 0,0:25:41.51,0:25:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stomachs talk with farts!
Comment: 0,0:25:47.17,0:25:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Onora!
Comment: 0,0:25:49.18,0:25:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gently put it on him, okay?
Comment: 0,0:25:55.64,0:25:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you, Onora.
Comment: 0,0:25:58.34,0:26:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Onora's been here ever since\N   Mom and Dad got married.
Comment: 0,0:26:02.50,0:26:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's around ninety years old in terms of human age.
Comment: 0,0:26:16.87,0:26:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel's mom is weird.
Comment: 0,0:26:19.80,0:26:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always sneaking around.
Comment: 0,0:26:22.12,0:26:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not weird!
Comment: 0,0:26:23.73,0:26:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama is...
Comment: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom is...
Comment: 0,0:26:26.98,0:26:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Comment: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,66)}He's using boku, a gender-neutral personal pronoun, commonly used by children.
Comment: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still using "I".
Comment: 0,0:26:30.48,0:26:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like a child! How spoiled!
Comment: 0,0:26:32.95,0:26:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the weird one, Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy who loves her mother is weird.
Comment: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't! I...
Comment: 0,0:26:41.57,0:26:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I... hate her!
Comment: 0,0:26:43.96,0:26:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I love my mom.
Comment: 0,0:26:45.59,0:26:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Comment: 0,0:26:46.81,0:26:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you, Dita!
Comment: 0,0:26:55.69,0:26:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Dita?
Comment: 0,0:27:04.79,0:27:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pretty good.
Comment: 0,0:27:09.41,0:27:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's for this month.
Comment: 0,0:27:11.34,0:27:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Comment: 0,0:27:13.04,0:27:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, could you take a look at this?
Comment: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There was someone who brought in Hibiol.
Comment: 0,0:27:30.97,0:27:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Comment: 0,0:27:32.73,0:27:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,At Mezarte's castle,
Comment: 0,0:27:34.87,0:27:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the prince shall be engaged
Comment: 0,0:27:37.86,0:27:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to the beautiful...
Comment: 0,0:27:40.50,0:27:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lei... lia...
Comment: 0,0:27:43.17,0:27:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can board the boat Darel uses for\N  materials, from what I've heard from him.{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:27:52.07,0:27:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's that girl.
Comment: 0,0:27:53.23,0:27:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like there are things that aligned perfectly.
Comment: 0,0:27:57.94,0:27:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But what will you do about Ariel?
Comment: 0,0:28:01.92,0:28:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking a child to a long trip \N is harder than what you can imagine.
Comment: 0,0:28:06.75,0:28:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, factoring in all other circumstances.
Comment: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can look over Ariel here.
Comment: 0,0:28:13.81,0:28:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Comment: 0,0:28:15.22,0:28:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Comment: 0,0:28:16.54,0:28:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:28:30.83,0:28:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, if you bury him too deep,
Comment: 0,0:28:33.52,0:28:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and if...
Comment: 0,0:28:34.57,0:28:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,if Onora came back from the dead--
Comment: 0,0:28:36.19,0:28:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Comment: 0,0:28:37.79,0:28:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's shallow, the stray dogs can dig him up.
Comment: 0,0:28:40.94,0:28:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Comment: 0,0:28:55.83,0:28:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you place soil on him, I can't meet him anymore.
Comment: 0,0:28:58.16,0:29:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always meet him here.
Comment: 0,0:29:01.14,0:29:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you place soil on him, I can't play with him anymore.
Comment: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a proper greeting.
Comment: 0,0:29:05.83,0:29:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He lived a peaceful and pain-free life.
Comment: 0,0:29:10.41,0:29:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will come to face this day.
Comment: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It just so happened that \N Onora's came faster than us.
Comment: 0,0:29:23.05,0:29:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:29:25.12,0:29:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Comment: 0,0:29:30.58,0:29:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Comment: 0,0:29:32.37,0:29:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Does everyone die?
Comment: 0,0:29:34.56,0:29:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Mom?
Comment: 0,0:29:37.70,0:29:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:29:43.26,0:29:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:29:44.45,0:29:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Comment: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I said wait!
Comment: 0,0:29:52.50,0:29:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel will...
Comment: 0,0:29:54.86,0:29:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone will... meet...
Comment: 0,0:29:58.98,0:29:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that day...
Comment: 0,0:30:00.71,0:30:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,way faster than me!
Comment: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia...
Comment: 0,0:30:05.75,0:30:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't not know that...
Comment: 0,0:30:08.50,0:30:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that, but...
Comment: 0,0:30:10.62,0:30:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Comment: 0,0:30:12.58,0:30:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about the order!
Comment: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry!
Comment: 0,0:30:19.47,0:30:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you, Lang!
Comment: 0,0:30:22.18,0:30:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you Ariel's mother?
Comment: 0,0:30:26.37,0:30:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mothers don't cry!
Comment: 0,0:30:28.82,0:30:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother is...
Comment: 0,0:30:31.80,0:30:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure mothers don't cry!
Comment: 0,0:30:39.15,0:30:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cry.
Comment: 0,0:30:41.02,0:30:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't cry.
Comment: 0,0:30:45.09,0:30:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Comment: 0,0:30:47.25,0:30:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I won't cry.
Comment: 0,0:30:53.26,0:30:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Comment: 0,0:30:54.29,0:30:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Comment: 0,0:30:59.62,0:31:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:31:08.26,0:31:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you wait for me?
Comment: 0,0:31:10.56,0:31:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and sleep on the bed.
Comment: 0,0:31:19.22,0:31:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten heavier.
Comment: 0,0:31:21.20,0:31:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Comment: 0,0:31:24.30,0:31:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You still smell like the sun.
Comment: 0,0:31:27.09,0:31:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cry.
Comment: 0,0:31:29.66,0:31:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm your mother, Ariel.
Comment: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we'll always be together.
Comment: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier...
Comment: 0,0:31:39.54,0:31:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier...
Comment: 0,0:31:41.02,0:31:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier...
Comment: 0,0:31:42.48,0:31:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier...
Comment: 0,0:31:44.06,0:31:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier...
Comment: 0,0:31:47.22,0:31:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier...
Comment: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier...
Comment: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Ariel, he's already gone.
Comment: 0,0:32:03.30,0:32:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay with not seeing them off?
Comment: 0,0:32:22.93,0:32:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see the outside!
Comment: 0,0:32:24.27,0:32:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't do it!
Comment: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:32:28.02,0:32:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, didn't you promise
Comment: 0,0:32:30.39,0:32:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that you'll stay here and be a good kid!
Comment: 0,0:32:32.78,0:32:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry.
Comment: 0,0:32:37.42,0:32:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia?
Comment: 0,0:32:42.15,0:32:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive, Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:32:44.46,0:32:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive... Krim!
Comment: 0,0:32:54.37,0:32:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mezarte is after the blood of\N  the long-living people of Iorph.
Comment: 0,0:32:59.81,0:33:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The village was attacked...
Comment: 0,0:33:02.27,0:33:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and Leilia was...
Comment: 0,0:33:04.17,0:33:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, who's Leilia?
Comment: 0,0:33:07.22,0:33:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're letting him call you Mom?
Comment: 0,0:33:09.87,0:33:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no!
Comment: 0,0:33:11.10,0:33:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting him call me Mom is...
Comment: 0,0:33:13.29,0:33:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm not angry.
Comment: 0,0:33:15.16,0:33:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not blaming you.
Comment: 0,0:33:17.22,0:33:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that... The Elder always says...
Comment: 0,0:33:22.13,0:33:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I haven't forgotten.
Comment: 0,0:33:25.61,0:33:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all is good.
Comment: 0,0:33:58.16,0:34:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning, there will be a \N parade to celebrate the Prince's wedding.
Comment: 0,0:34:03.13,0:34:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince's envoy emanating from the Royal Palace
Comment: 0,0:34:05.69,0:34:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,will cross the bridge to meet with \N Leilia's envoy that will come to the villa.
Comment: 0,0:34:10.32,0:34:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, we attack the \N Renato carrying the Prince,
Comment: 0,0:34:13.26,0:34:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,causing a ruckus
Comment: 0,0:34:14.66,0:34:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,thinning out the security at the villa...
Comment: 0,0:34:17.99,0:34:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll take back Leilia.
Comment: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also watch the parade.
Comment: 0,0:34:23.85,0:34:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Sorry, do that next time.
Comment: 0,0:34:27.97,0:34:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Comment: 0,0:34:29.57,0:34:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home!
Comment: 0,0:34:31.57,0:34:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel?
Comment: 0,0:34:34.15,0:34:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not like Mom when you're here!
Comment: 0,0:34:45.33,0:34:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel.
Comment: 0,0:34:47.00,0:34:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggly bugs...
Comment: 0,0:34:48.84,0:34:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,are here!
Comment: 0,0:34:50.18,0:34:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggle wiggle wiggle wiggle!
Comment: 0,0:35:16.00,0:35:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of things here to\N  celebrate this auspicious day!
Comment: 0,0:35:26.04,0:35:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have now called into the royal\N family the blood of the Iorph!
Comment: 0,0:35:32.79,0:35:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Renato and the Iorph.
Comment: 0,0:35:35.14,0:35:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient legends that remained in the present
Comment: 0,0:35:38.42,0:35:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,have now been both obtained by us!
Comment: 0,0:35:41.84,0:35:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We, who have been chosen by the gods,
Comment: 0,0:35:44.32,0:35:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,now have no enemy to fear!
Comment: 0,0:35:51.83,0:35:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And with Prince Hazel and\N  Princess Leilia's engagement,
Comment: 0,0:35:56.77,0:36:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a new legend is born at Mezarte!
Comment: 0,0:37:15.62,0:37:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...!
Comment: 0,0:37:31.83,0:37:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An assassin?
Comment: 0,0:37:33.06,0:37:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Comment: 0,0:37:42.07,0:37:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia... Leilia....
Comment: 0,0:37:53.10,0:37:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry about that!
Comment: 0,0:38:02.59,0:38:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia!
Comment: 0,0:38:06.43,0:38:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia.
Comment: 0,0:38:08.21,0:38:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Comment: 0,0:38:10.26,0:38:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim is also here.
Comment: 0,0:38:13.11,0:38:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim?
Comment: 0,0:38:14.25,0:38:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go!
Comment: 0,0:38:15.79,0:38:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting for you!
Comment: 0,0:38:18.26,0:38:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia?
Comment: 0,0:38:20.47,0:38:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go.
Comment: 0,0:38:23.43,0:38:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Comment: 0,0:38:25.84,0:38:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can't run.
Comment: 0,0:38:27.95,0:38:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Comment: 0,0:38:29.22,0:38:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very agile!
Comment: 0,0:38:31.08,0:38:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Comment: 0,0:38:32.18,0:38:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can even jump the castle's high fence...
Comment: 0,0:38:44.49,0:38:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't meet Krim anymore.
Comment: 0,0:38:49.13,0:38:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Comment: 0,0:38:50.82,0:38:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just...
Comment: 0,0:38:51.70,0:38:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia!
Comment: 0,0:38:54.91,0:38:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:38:57.21,0:38:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Leilia!
Comment: 0,0:38:59.49,0:39:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Comment: 0,0:39:00.47,0:39:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay! I can jump, can't I?
Comment: 0,0:39:03.84,0:39:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Comment: 0,0:39:16.57,0:39:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia.
Comment: 0,0:39:19.02,0:39:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After them!
Comment: 0,0:39:19.44,0:39:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Comment: 0,0:39:20.69,0:39:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lay your hands on her,
Comment: 0,0:39:33.74,0:39:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia.
Comment: 0,0:39:43.12,0:39:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can
Comment: 0,0:39:45.57,0:39:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,jump.
Comment: 0,0:39:53.82,0:39:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the baby gotten big?
Comment: 0,0:39:57.01,0:39:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He could've been six if he has lived.
Comment: 0,0:40:00.70,0:40:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of the outside world?
Comment: 0,0:40:04.66,0:40:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an Iorphian too.
Comment: 0,0:40:07.15,0:40:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Only half though.
Comment: 0,0:40:09.38,0:40:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Racina--
Comment: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Elder
Comment: 0,0:40:11.99,0:40:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,made it a taboo for Iorphians to go outside
Comment: 0,0:40:16.96,0:40:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,because they would know what \N fate they will have afterwards.
Comment: 0,0:40:22.35,0:40:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they didn't wish for it,
Comment: 0,0:40:23.95,0:40:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll be given weird looks, abused,
Comment: 0,0:40:28.47,0:40:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and eventually become detested and discarded.
Comment: 0,0:40:32.28,0:40:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Comment: 0,0:40:33.36,0:40:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Clan of Partings is an existence \N always struck by separation.
Comment: 0,0:40:43.27,0:40:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you have a pretty satisfying life.
Comment: 0,0:41:04.53,0:41:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim, your wounds...
Comment: 0,0:41:12.53,0:41:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you take off your coat?
Comment: 0,0:41:19.62,0:41:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A baby... how?
Comment: 0,0:41:23.88,0:41:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How does one... become a mother?
Comment: 0,0:41:28.74,0:41:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I a mother?
Comment: 0,0:41:34.16,0:41:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The things I didn't know
Comment: 0,0:41:35.80,0:41:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,were taught to me by Mido.
Comment: 0,0:41:38.56,0:41:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got help,
Comment: 0,0:41:40.55,0:41:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so it felt like I'm treating \N him like a younger brother
Comment: 0,0:41:43.44,0:41:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but, it's a little different.
Comment: 0,0:41:47.46,0:41:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I get really happy whenever Ariel smiles.
Comment: 0,0:41:52.08,0:41:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Comment: 0,0:41:53.49,0:41:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If Ariel smiles when he's with me,
Comment: 0,0:41:57.54,0:41:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll stay with him...
Comment: 0,0:41:59.58,0:42:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird story.
Comment: 0,0:42:04.15,0:42:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel will die before us.
Comment: 0,0:42:08.37,0:42:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel will
Comment: 0,0:42:10.02,0:42:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,make you alone, Maquia.
Comment: 0,0:42:17.50,0:42:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make her cry!
Comment: 0,0:42:18.56,0:42:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it, Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't make my mom cry!
Comment: 0,0:42:22.07,0:42:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:42:24.67,0:42:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you protect them?
Comment: 0,0:42:27.57,0:42:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The things that you treasure the most?
Comment: 0,0:42:51.95,0:42:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stay here in Mezarte to rescue Leilia.
Comment: 0,0:42:56.49,0:42:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get in the way since you have a child.
Comment: 0,0:43:00.18,0:43:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why, Maquia,
Comment: 0,0:43:03.32,0:43:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,this is goodbye.
Comment: 0,0:43:07.36,0:43:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll go back home?{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:43:09.75,0:43:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't go to our home.
Comment: 0,0:43:12.46,0:43:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What about everyone?
Comment: 0,0:43:15.68,0:43:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us will be going to a new place.
Comment: 0,0:43:19.54,0:43:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,By "new place",
Comment: 0,0:43:21.12,0:43:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you mean Mido and Brother Lang isn't there?
Comment: 0,0:43:25.89,0:43:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Comment: 0,0:43:27.21,0:43:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That became a full farewell to them.
Comment: 0,0:43:30.70,0:43:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay as long as Mom is with me!
Comment: 0,0:43:33.98,0:43:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm okay as long as \N you're with me, Ariel.
Comment: 0,0:43:39.16,0:43:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No can do.
Comment: 0,0:43:40.81,0:43:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a reason, didn't you?
Comment: 0,0:43:42.72,0:43:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You caused trouble and ran away.\N Had enough of that already!
Comment: 0,0:43:49.22,0:43:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:43:52.02,0:43:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry!
Comment: 0,0:43:53.46,0:43:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait up!
Comment: 0,0:43:55.42,0:43:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Comment: 0,0:43:57.41,0:43:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going around a bit more,
Comment: 0,0:44:00.10,0:44:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so wait at the room of this inn, okay?
Comment: 0,0:44:03.25,0:44:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to.
Comment: 0,0:44:04.26,0:44:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait here. I beg you.
Comment: 0,0:44:11.87,0:44:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Comment: 0,0:44:13.77,0:44:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Our specialty is alcohol
Comment: 0,0:44:16.43,0:44:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so it'll be a nightly job,
Comment: 0,0:44:18.30,0:44:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're okay with that, right?
Comment: 0,0:44:20.32,0:44:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nightly?
Comment: 0,0:44:22.30,0:44:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Any problem with that?
Comment: 0,0:44:25.03,0:44:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My child is, uhmm...
Comment: 0,0:44:27.27,0:44:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,still small,
Comment: 0,0:44:30.98,0:44:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the girl who previously quit was also the same.
Comment: 0,0:44:33.96,0:44:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They really don't think too much \N at this young of an age.
Comment: 0,0:44:36.81,0:44:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's different...
Comment: 0,0:44:38.46,0:44:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Different? What's different?
Comment: 0,0:44:40.68,0:44:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're not aware you're a mother?
Comment: 0,0:44:44.11,0:44:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to tell you,
Comment: 0,0:44:45.66,0:44:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no one that'll give a job\N to someone like that.
Comment: 0,0:45:04.30,0:45:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Comment: 0,0:45:07.52,0:45:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Comment: 0,0:45:11.28,0:45:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, take a look!
Comment: 0,0:45:12.97,0:45:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I made Hibiol...
Comment: 0,0:45:20.45,0:45:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me do more work.
Comment: 0,0:45:23.77,0:45:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you take this out on your own?
Comment: 0,0:45:28.57,0:45:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, take a look, Mo--
Comment: 0,0:45:30.36,0:45:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you listen to what I say?
Comment: 0,0:45:33.06,0:45:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Comment: 0,0:45:34.11,0:45:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you get in the way earlier?
Comment: 0,0:45:36.04,0:45:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't work, we won't be able to eat!
Comment: 0,0:45:40.69,0:45:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Comment: 0,0:45:41.72,0:45:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you making trouble for me?
Comment: 0,0:45:44.70,0:45:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Comment: 0,0:45:47.06,0:45:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The wiggly bugs are here!
Comment: 0,0:45:49.56,0:45:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggle wiggle wiggle wiggle...
Comment: 0,0:45:50.93,0:45:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggle wiggle wiggle wiggle...
Comment: 0,0:45:53.12,0:45:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought some dinner.
Comment: 0,0:46:00.20,0:46:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:46:09.74,0:46:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... no mother.
Comment: 0,0:46:13.36,0:46:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the self-awareness
Comment: 0,0:46:15.95,0:46:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm a mother.
Comment: 0,0:46:18.33,0:46:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just imitating one,
Comment: 0,0:46:21.99,0:46:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mido was there with me,
Comment: 0,0:46:24.66,0:46:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you must never love anyone.{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:46:27.06,0:46:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once you love someone, you'll truly be alone.{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:46:32.22,0:46:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,True...
Comment: 0,0:46:34.78,0:46:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,lonesomeness.
Comment: 0,0:46:49.42,0:46:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Comment: 0,0:46:53.70,0:46:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mom...{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:47:09.56,0:47:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:47:15.87,0:47:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:47:18.20,0:47:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Comment: 0,0:47:20.36,0:47:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:47:25.20,0:47:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:47:26.19,0:47:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Comment: 0,0:47:28.51,0:47:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:47:35.90,0:47:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You got fooled!
Comment: 0,0:47:38.26,0:47:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought that was my shed skin, didn't you?
Comment: 0,0:47:46.62,0:47:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shed skin...
Comment: 0,0:47:47.96,0:47:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She laughed!
Comment: 0,0:47:51.08,0:47:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:47:55.53,0:47:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Comment: 0,0:47:58.14,0:47:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Comment: 0,0:48:00.40,0:48:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you won't get any bigger than this.
Comment: 0,0:48:06.37,0:48:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna!
Comment: 0,0:48:09.73,0:48:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't grow up, I can't protect you!
Comment: 0,0:48:18.61,0:48:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom cried again.
Comment: 0,0:48:22.70,0:48:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cry anymore!
Comment: 0,0:48:24.55,0:48:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a mother!
Comment: 0,0:48:30.26,0:48:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a promise.
Comment: 0,0:48:31.91,0:48:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Comment: 0,0:48:41.78,0:48:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel, you promise that too.
Comment: 0,0:48:44.24,0:48:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I promise!
Comment: 0,0:48:46.64,0:48:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, Mom.
Comment: 0,0:49:04.94,0:49:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, nice and steady.
Comment: 0,0:49:30.67,0:49:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, it's done!
Comment: 0,0:49:32.55,0:49:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:49:34.18,0:49:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Comment: 0,0:49:38.48,0:49:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you pay your previous debt.
Comment: 0,0:49:41.17,0:49:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? You trying to impress a girl?
Comment: 0,0:49:43.41,0:49:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that! Quit messing with me!
Comment: 0,0:49:46.82,0:49:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This angle can only be made \N through experience alone.
Comment: 0,0:49:53.97,0:49:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I told you to stop, didn't I?
Comment: 0,0:49:56.53,0:49:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it could've gone well though.
Comment: 0,0:49:59.25,0:50:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Comment: 0,0:50:04.89,0:50:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia, three Cherubies!
Comment: 0,0:50:07.20,0:50:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Comment: 0,0:50:09.46,0:50:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right away!
Comment: 0,0:50:10.47,0:50:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some as well.
Comment: 0,0:50:11.78,0:50:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Comment: 0,0:50:13.95,0:50:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The lady's got some nice bums!
Comment: 0,0:50:17.46,0:50:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Comment: 0,0:50:19.85,0:50:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, you two sure don't look alike.
Comment: 0,0:50:23.49,0:50:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,呐
Comment: 0,0:50:24.78,0:50:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it around a year already \N since you came here?
Comment: 0,0:50:28.80,0:50:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you came from before?
Comment: 0,0:50:31.83,0:50:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a rumor where you \Ntwo being siblings is a lie
Comment: 0,0:50:34.50,0:50:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and that you're a couple that has eloped.
Comment: 0,0:50:38.18,0:50:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Comment: 0,0:50:41.07,0:50:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you very much.
Comment: 0,0:50:45.16,0:50:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Comment: 0,0:50:49.95,0:50:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,More new ones came in.
Comment: 0,0:50:52.39,0:50:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How many lookouts do they need to be satisfied?
Comment: 0,0:50:55.49,0:50:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, iron is the sign of the times.
Comment: 0,0:50:58.19,0:51:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Mezarte is making cannons like a frenzy,
Comment: 0,0:51:00.70,0:51:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,we all get to eat.
Comment: 0,0:51:21.92,0:51:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, this seems a bit off.
Comment: 0,0:51:24.91,0:51:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they planning to start a war?
Comment: 0,0:51:27.43,0:51:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No way that dimwit Prince can lead the army.
Comment: 0,0:51:30.45,0:51:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn right.
Comment: 0,0:51:37.75,0:51:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always like this.
Comment: 0,0:51:39.76,0:51:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the noise.
Comment: 0,0:51:41.48,0:51:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You may choose from here.
Comment: 0,0:51:54.14,0:51:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:51:55.73,0:51:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Lang?
Comment: 0,0:51:58.56,0:52:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is you, Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:52:00.01,0:52:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't change at all!
Comment: 0,0:52:01.51,0:52:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's natural, though.
Comment: 0,0:52:02.94,0:52:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You changed a lot, Lang!
Comment: 0,0:52:04.90,0:52:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you grow like that?
Comment: 0,0:52:07.22,0:52:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't treat people like they're wheat.
Comment: 0,0:52:11.66,0:52:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:52:13.83,0:52:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,0:52:15.88,0:52:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lang! Brother Lang!
Comment: 0,0:52:18.69,0:52:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Ariel?
Comment: 0,0:52:31.87,0:52:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it okay to impose myself here?
Comment: 0,0:52:33.53,0:52:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Sorry if it's messy.
Comment: 0,0:52:36.68,0:52:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm glad.
Comment: 0,0:52:38.28,0:52:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are Mido and Deol doing fine?
Comment: 0,0:52:40.37,0:52:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:52:41.43,0:52:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But only towns like Doriel have great views.
Comment: 0,0:52:44.93,0:52:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At the countryside, everything's getting old.
Comment: 0,0:52:47.83,0:52:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Deol got out of town...
Comment: 0,0:52:49.20,0:52:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks.
Comment: 0,0:52:50.63,0:52:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Deol also try to find a job?
Comment: 0,0:52:52.73,0:52:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, he won't live.
Comment: 0,0:52:55.25,0:52:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go out for a bit.
Comment: 0,0:52:59.22,0:53:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you're gonna go to a date?
Comment: 0,0:53:01.60,0:53:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I got night duty.
Comment: 0,0:53:05.19,0:53:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be safe out there, Ariel.
Comment: 0,0:53:07.49,0:53:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prepare a light meal for you.
Comment: 0,0:53:18.78,0:53:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since we came here and took in jobs,
Comment: 0,0:53:21.97,0:53:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,he's been working very hard.
Comment: 0,0:53:24.18,0:53:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Comment: 0,0:53:25.88,0:53:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sell Hibiol, right?
Comment: 0,0:53:28.62,0:53:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And, because of me, we can't stay in one place.
Comment: 0,0:53:35.88,0:53:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... You're right.
Comment: 0,0:53:38.63,0:53:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he already knows
Comment: 0,0:53:41.35,0:53:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not blood-related.
Comment: 0,0:53:45.31,0:53:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:53:46.79,0:53:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Around five years ago.
Comment: 0,0:53:48.82,0:53:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,From when he said we should sleep separately.
Comment: 0,0:53:52.31,0:53:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped calling me Mom,
Comment: 0,0:53:56.21,0:53:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"hey" and "wait"
Comment: 0,0:53:59.63,0:54:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,are all that I hear from him!
Comment: 0,0:54:00.96,0:54:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be in that stage. He's a guy, after all.
Comment: 0,0:54:04.79,0:54:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Lang,
Comment: 0,0:54:07.09,0:54:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,do you know what happened to Leilia?
Comment: 0,0:54:19.42,0:54:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one dead.
Comment: 0,0:54:23.72,0:54:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn it to the bones and ensure that \Nthe ashes are buried deep underground.
Comment: 0,0:54:30.20,0:54:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Comment: 0,0:54:31.59,0:54:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Lady Medmel.
Comment: 0,0:54:34.21,0:54:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, where's my dear Father?
Comment: 0,0:54:36.04,0:54:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Hazel is busy.
Comment: 0,0:54:41.09,0:54:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mo--
Comment: 0,0:54:43.53,0:54:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Medmel?
Comment: 0,0:54:47.37,0:54:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing?
Comment: 0,0:54:50.33,0:54:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hair like the moon's color, \Na golden ring appears in their eyes,
Comment: 0,0:54:54.46,0:54:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and Iorphians are said to have hypothermia,
Comment: 0,0:54:58.09,0:55:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but any of those have not \N manifested in Lady Medmel.
Comment: 0,0:55:01.92,0:55:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Comment: 0,0:55:03.08,0:55:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we cannot bear a son that  \N can inherit the throne,
Comment: 0,0:55:05.80,0:55:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,then what's the use of \Nhaving that monster exist?
Comment: 0,0:55:10.68,0:55:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been hard for her to be  \Npregnant after Lady Medmel
Comment: 0,0:55:13.78,0:55:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and it seems that both Master Hazel  \N have grown tired of Lady Leilia.
Comment: 0,0:55:18.81,0:55:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor Hazel!
Comment: 0,0:55:21.44,0:55:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something about it!
Comment: 0,0:55:22.76,0:55:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,At least supply her another woman!
Comment: 0,0:55:25.81,0:55:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Comment: 0,0:55:26.61,0:55:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll look for any Iorphian survivors
Comment: 0,0:55:29.17,0:55:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and make her a replacement vessel.
Comment: 0,0:55:32.43,0:55:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna!
Comment: 0,0:55:33.44,0:55:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia!
Comment: 0,0:55:36.12,0:55:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to wear these decorations,
Comment: 0,0:55:38.74,0:55:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,if he doesn't want to sleep with me anymore,
Comment: 0,0:55:41.04,0:55:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be sent away already!
Comment: 0,0:55:48.02,0:55:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia has...
Comment: 0,0:55:49.30,0:55:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me.
Comment: 0,0:55:56.89,0:55:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Renato has died, right?
Comment: 0,0:55:59.29,0:55:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:56:01.39,0:56:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I gave birth to Medmel,
Comment: 0,0:56:04.59,0:56:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been caged up here.
Comment: 0,0:56:08.15,0:56:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have not met them ever since.
Comment: 0,0:56:12.50,0:56:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure...
Comment: 0,0:56:14.54,0:56:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the same as the Renato.
Comment: 0,0:56:17.47,0:56:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vague existences that live only in legends.
Comment: 0,0:56:23.47,0:56:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the clan that can take flight,
Comment: 0,0:56:26.08,0:56:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and the flower that sings at dawn,
Comment: 0,0:56:28.34,0:56:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,can't live in this world.
Comment: 0,0:56:31.58,0:56:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you can resist.
Comment: 0,0:56:34.06,0:56:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To search for the path to leave a legend.
Comment: 0,0:56:39.10,0:56:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rich coming from you.
Comment: 0,0:56:42.09,0:56:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed off a legend.
Comment: 0,0:57:04.60,0:57:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to atone.
Comment: 0,0:57:07.17,0:57:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullshit!
Comment: 0,0:57:09.50,0:57:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me see Medmel!
Comment: 0,0:57:12.13,0:57:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me see her?
Comment: 0,0:57:14.83,0:57:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she the child I bore?
Comment: 0,0:57:17.97,0:57:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've... already forgotten her scent.
Comment: 0,0:57:23.21,0:57:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the softness I felt when I hugged her.
Comment: 0,0:57:26.91,0:57:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Comment: 0,0:57:28.77,0:57:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How much more are you gonna take away from me?
Comment: 0,0:57:32.87,0:57:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how much...
Comment: 0,0:57:34.50,0:57:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you want me to become alone?
Comment: 0,0:57:39.03,0:57:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want me to meet Medmel,
Comment: 0,0:57:41.71,0:57:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to Maquia!
Comment: 0,0:57:47.31,0:57:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Comment: 0,0:57:49.04,0:57:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Iorph Maquia,
Comment: 0,0:57:51.60,0:57:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want her
Comment: 0,0:57:53.37,0:57:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,to become... alone.
Comment: 0,0:58:07.54,0:58:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been really elaborate.
Comment: 0,0:58:09.92,0:58:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It always has been the two of us, isn't it?
Comment: 0,0:58:12.24,0:58:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been any visitors at our place before.
Comment: 0,0:58:19.38,0:58:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you help me out?
Comment: 0,0:58:31.09,0:58:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown again.
Comment: 0,0:58:33.12,0:58:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell.
Comment: 0,0:58:40.54,0:58:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia, we gotta talk.
Comment: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give me some time \Nafter you're done?
Comment: 0,0:58:45.49,0:58:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but I'm still...
Comment: 0,0:58:46.85,0:58:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take some sips while waiting for you.
Comment: 0,0:58:49.32,0:58:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia, go and deliver those now!
Comment: 0,0:58:51.21,0:58:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Comment: 0,0:58:57.64,0:59:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been holding back since I \Nthought she was your girl.
Comment: 0,0:59:01.21,0:59:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Comment: 0,0:59:03.01,0:59:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot more good guys out there, right?
Comment: 0,0:59:07.29,0:59:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For her to be taken by this bastard--
Comment: 0,0:59:09.49,0:59:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That person isn't like that.
Comment: 0,0:59:12.08,0:59:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That person?
Comment: 0,0:59:13.60,0:59:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten gloomy.
Comment: 0,0:59:15.63,0:59:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, have a drink!
Comment: 0,0:59:17.52,0:59:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Comment: 0,0:59:18.72,0:59:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't a brat anymore, aren't you?
Comment: 0,0:59:26.01,0:59:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Comment: 0,0:59:27.33,0:59:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you can handle this too.
Comment: 0,0:59:30.75,0:59:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time for you to join the adults.
Comment: 0,0:59:33.29,0:59:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Comment: 0,0:59:35.38,0:59:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a man,
Comment: 0,0:59:37.33,0:59:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire up! Slam it!
Comment: 0,0:59:39.28,0:59:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire up! Slam it!
Comment: 0,0:59:41.30,0:59:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hup ho! Hup ho!
Comment: 0,0:59:43.25,0:59:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hup ho! Hup ho!
Comment: 0,0:59:45.25,0:59:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave ho!
Comment: 0,0:59:47.02,0:59:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad at all!
Comment: 0,0:59:48.31,0:59:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go for another round then!
Comment: 0,0:59:50.18,0:59:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's become men!
Comment: 0,0:59:57.05,0:59:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're looking for me?
Comment: 0,1:00:01.15,1:00:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay at this town anymore.
Comment: 0,1:00:04.43,1:00:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna come with me \N back to the farm?
Comment: 0,1:00:07.09,1:00:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? But...
Comment: 0,1:00:08.73,1:00:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll work out.
Comment: 0,1:00:10.24,1:00:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The price of goat's milk has gone up.
Comment: 0,1:00:12.56,1:00:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're with Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:00:14.48,1:00:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't inconvenience you.
Comment: 0,1:00:16.34,1:00:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia.
Comment: 0,1:00:17.68,1:00:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mido and Deol got caught up in this,
Comment: 0,1:00:22.21,1:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Comment: 0,1:00:24.55,1:00:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you...
Comment: 0,1:00:26.70,1:00:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to trouble me.
Comment: 0,1:00:29.86,1:00:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a kid,
Comment: 0,1:00:31.93,1:00:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be your strength.
Comment: 0,1:00:35.82,1:00:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to consider it, Maquia.
Comment: 0,1:00:38.88,1:00:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,About your future,
Comment: 0,1:00:40.63,1:00:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and uhmm...
Comment: 0,1:00:43.46,1:00:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,about us.
Comment: 0,1:01:01.95,1:01:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's impossible
Comment: 0,1:01:03.52,1:01:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to think about it.
Comment: 0,1:01:06.45,1:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel's the only one I've been thinking of.
Comment: 0,1:01:11.91,1:01:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I live with Ariel?
Comment: 0,1:01:16.13,1:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I become more of a mother to him?
Comment: 0,1:01:20.42,1:01:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't seem to find an answer.
Comment: 0,1:01:25.83,1:01:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to find an answer even now.
Comment: 0,1:01:32.50,1:01:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not smart.
Comment: 0,1:01:36.42,1:01:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to continue
Comment: 0,1:01:40.66,1:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking about Ariel...
Comment: 0,1:01:48.65,1:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Comment: 0,1:01:50.55,1:01:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Comment: 0,1:01:52.20,1:01:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,let me help you find a new place and work.
Comment: 0,1:01:57.20,1:01:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoulder it alone.
Comment: 0,1:02:30.42,1:02:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel?
Comment: 0,1:02:36.04,1:02:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Comment: 0,1:02:38.92,1:02:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You reek of booze.
Comment: 0,1:02:40.67,1:02:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hooome.
Comment: 0,1:02:42.01,1:02:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that now!
Comment: 0,1:02:43.72,1:02:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ariel?
Comment: 0,1:02:44.79,1:02:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my just-got-home kiss?
Comment: 0,1:02:47.28,1:02:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always done that back then.
Comment: 0,1:02:54.94,1:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Comment: 0,1:02:56.59,1:02:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you still get up?
Comment: 0,1:02:59.12,1:03:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,, We've been thought as lovers that eloped.
Comment: 0,1:03:05.73,1:03:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're about to be taken by another man.
Comment: 0,1:03:09.72,1:03:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Comment: 0,1:03:11.24,1:03:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stand up!
Comment: 0,1:03:13.55,1:03:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna sleep, do it on the bed...
Comment: 0,1:03:25.26,1:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you walk?
Comment: 0,1:03:33.75,1:03:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't step on that!
Comment: 0,1:03:42.12,1:03:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Comment: 0,1:03:44.64,1:03:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,something you've woven, isn't it?
Comment: 0,1:03:52.58,1:03:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've grown to hate it.
Comment: 0,1:03:56.27,1:03:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you keeping this?
Comment: 0,1:03:59.45,1:04:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always treating me like a kid!
Comment: 0,1:04:29.54,1:04:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It has never changed.
Comment: 0,1:04:35.65,1:04:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something precious.
Comment: 0,1:04:41.44,1:04:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,1:04:47.80,1:04:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Ariel,
Comment: 0,1:04:49.80,1:04:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to move again.
Comment: 0,1:04:54.22,1:04:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you wanna go next?
Comment: 0,1:04:56.39,1:04:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine anywhere.
Comment: 0,1:04:59.56,1:05:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you.
Comment: 0,1:05:02.71,1:05:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Comment: 0,1:05:04.57,1:05:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,think of you as my mother.
Comment: 0,1:05:32.65,1:05:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you put in a word
Comment: 0,1:05:35.55,1:05:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,to make me a soldier at the castle?
Comment: 0,1:05:41.20,1:05:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Comment: 0,1:05:43.33,1:05:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia will be feel sad about this.
Comment: 0,1:05:45.82,1:05:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not my mother anyway.
Comment: 0,1:05:48.86,1:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say that?
Comment: 0,1:05:52.15,1:05:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say that to Maquia?
Comment: 0,1:05:54.80,1:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Comment: 0,1:05:57.89,1:05:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know
Comment: 0,1:05:59.52,1:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,what kind of emotions \N Maquia felt while raising you?
Comment: 0,1:06:03.74,1:06:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be naive!
Comment: 0,1:06:05.49,1:06:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When she was your age now,
Comment: 0,1:06:07.30,1:06:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia was desparately trying to \N become a mother to you.
Comment: 0,1:06:10.17,1:06:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And you...
Comment: 0,1:06:11.09,1:06:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know!
Comment: 0,1:06:15.01,1:06:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that person... treating me carefully?
Comment: 0,1:06:23.58,1:06:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:06:25.25,1:06:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Being always there
Comment: 0,1:06:27.86,1:06:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and desperately doing things for my sake
Comment: 0,1:06:31.25,1:06:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,are what I thought is what a mother is like.
Comment: 0,1:06:35.46,1:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I called her mom.
Comment: 0,1:06:41.46,1:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to protect her.
Comment: 0,1:06:46.95,1:06:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't protect her with \N the way that I am now.
Comment: 0,1:06:50.76,1:06:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Far from that,
Comment: 0,1:06:53.87,1:06:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hurt her.
Comment: 0,1:06:56.23,1:06:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've realized that feeling.
Comment: 0,1:07:00.81,1:07:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't... protect her by myself!
Comment: 0,1:07:16.39,1:07:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You crying like that
Comment: 0,1:07:19.14,1:07:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,was no different from when you were a baby.
Comment: 0,1:07:25.60,1:07:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with this?
Comment: 0,1:07:47.77,1:07:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll do it myself.
Comment: 0,1:07:50.27,1:07:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going out of town?
Comment: 0,1:07:52.73,1:07:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you off, Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:08:07.09,1:08:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep safe out there, Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:08:11.95,1:08:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Comment: 0,1:08:18.65,1:08:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going.
Comment: 0,1:08:55.21,1:08:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't... cry.
Comment: 0,1:08:58.40,1:08:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cry.
Comment: 0,1:09:00.32,1:09:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised.
Comment: 0,1:09:05.78,1:09:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel, you liar.
Comment: 0,1:09:08.78,1:09:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised to protect me...
Comment: 0,1:09:14.31,1:09:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar.
Comment: 0,1:09:17.76,1:09:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this.
Comment: 0,1:10:32.42,1:10:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought I'd see a real Renato.
Comment: 0,1:10:36.88,1:10:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't help it.
Comment: 0,1:10:38.45,1:10:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There were a lot of them before,\N but now there's only one at the castle.
Comment: 0,1:10:44.51,1:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Marching with a papier-mache Renato
Comment: 0,1:10:47.44,1:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,can't even raise our morale.
Comment: 0,1:10:50.56,1:10:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, did you know?
Comment: 0,1:10:52.40,1:10:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Baiera got their hands on another Iorph.
Comment: 0,1:10:55.04,1:10:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Baiera did? Really?
Comment: 0,1:11:00.39,1:11:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Division Commander, stop burning the lice.
Comment: 0,1:11:04.62,1:11:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Comment: 0,1:11:05.96,1:11:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Division Commander Lang!
Comment: 0,1:11:10.87,1:11:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're looking.
Comment: 0,1:11:13.59,1:11:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she's a girl that looks the \N same as Crown Princess Leilia in terms of age.
Comment: 0,1:11:19.23,1:11:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't sure yet that it's Maquia.
Comment: 0,1:11:22.16,1:11:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried?
Comment: 0,1:11:24.15,1:11:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That person
Comment: 0,1:11:25.63,1:11:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,is strong after all.
Comment: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia will be overjoyed to hear that.
Comment: 0,1:11:32.35,1:11:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been worried whether
Comment: 0,1:11:35.65,1:11:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you can protect yourself, hence her desperation.
Comment: 0,1:11:39.83,1:11:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to make you think she's \N a mother you can depend on.
Comment: 0,1:11:46.45,1:11:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a brat.
Comment: 0,1:11:51.65,1:11:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I might... be a brat.
Comment: 0,1:11:55.33,1:11:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Comment: 0,1:11:56.60,1:11:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,am going to be a father.
Comment: 0,1:12:07.57,1:12:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mezarte,
Comment: 0,1:12:09.17,1:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,O superficial nation,
Comment: 0,1:12:11.11,1:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you've exchanged ancient power with political power.
Comment: 0,1:12:14.01,1:12:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuing this blasphemy is such foolishness!
Comment: 0,1:12:17.46,1:12:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be asking us for our full support.
Comment: 0,1:12:41.12,1:12:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia.
Comment: 0,1:12:43.02,1:12:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The preparations are finally done.
Comment: 0,1:12:46.58,1:12:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair has grown.
Comment: 0,1:12:48.70,1:12:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,For an Iorph to grow hair beyond her hips,
Comment: 0,1:12:51.41,1:12:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you must be pregnant.
Comment: 0,1:12:54.30,1:12:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Maquia,
Comment: 0,1:12:55.86,1:12:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go meet Leilia.
Comment: 0,1:13:06.50,1:13:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Will there be a war?
Comment: 0,1:13:08.70,1:13:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only be painful at the start.
Comment: 0,1:13:11.41,1:13:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, these past few years,
Comment: 0,1:13:13.26,1:13:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you've endured pain beyond that.
Comment: 0,1:13:16.52,1:13:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You left Iorph, and everything \N you had got taken away.
Comment: 0,1:13:20.85,1:13:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone inside a cellar as if you're dying...
Comment: 0,1:13:24.74,1:13:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Say,
Comment: 0,1:13:26.75,1:13:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you've finally realized how we felt.
Comment: 0,1:13:30.03,1:13:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone got separated
Comment: 0,1:13:31.87,1:13:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and for sure the Elder isn't alive anymore.
Comment: 0,1:13:36.26,1:13:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sad to have lost everything.
Comment: 0,1:13:39.81,1:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Comment: 0,1:13:41.57,1:13:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you have felt happiness...
Comment: 0,1:13:45.23,1:13:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Iorph have all weaved the same cloth.
Comment: 0,1:13:49.24,1:13:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, you and Leilia,
Comment: 0,1:13:51.71,1:13:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not good that we have three different pasts.
Comment: 0,1:14:05.13,1:14:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Maquia.
Comment: 0,1:14:07.30,1:14:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, only your past has disappeared.
Comment: 0,1:14:10.62,1:14:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll once again weave a singular future.
Comment: 0,1:14:36.01,1:14:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita!
Comment: 0,1:14:38.44,1:14:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Ariel!
Comment: 0,1:14:45.53,1:14:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You got back earlier today.
Comment: 0,1:14:47.90,1:14:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm busy during these important times.
Comment: 0,1:14:49.43,1:14:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They said there's still some time left.
Comment: 0,1:14:55.97,1:14:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still worried.
Comment: 0,1:14:58.21,1:14:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner will be served soon.
Comment: 0,1:15:00.13,1:15:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Don't force yourself. I'll do it.
Comment: 0,1:15:03.57,1:15:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better if I can move around a bit.
Comment: 0,1:15:07.79,1:15:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, sit down.
Comment: 0,1:15:14.89,1:15:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time. Kinda strange.
Comment: 0,1:15:19.41,1:15:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked for a job, went out of Mezarte,
Comment: 0,1:15:23.01,1:15:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,met you again,
Comment: 0,1:15:26.56,1:15:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and now...
Comment: 0,1:15:30.29,1:15:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Ariel,
Comment: 0,1:15:32.48,1:15:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,are you really fine with me?
Comment: 0,1:15:38.97,1:15:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Comment: 0,1:16:06.44,1:16:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it Baiera?
Comment: 0,1:16:07.82,1:16:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't just Baieran ships.
Comment: 0,1:16:10.06,1:16:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's York's and Endra's too!
Comment: 0,1:16:18.56,1:16:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel, wait!
Comment: 0,1:16:21.33,1:16:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the child inside you!
Comment: 0,1:16:41.88,1:16:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late, Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:16:43.30,1:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Comment: 0,1:16:51.24,1:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've received word that Baieran \N soldiers have breached the pass.
Comment: 0,1:16:55.10,1:16:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Split into two--
Comment: 0,1:17:01.51,1:17:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How ironic.
Comment: 0,1:17:10.65,1:17:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mezarte has utilized ancient powers \N to show off their own.
Comment: 0,1:17:16.67,1:17:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And in reverse,
Comment: 0,1:17:18.28,1:17:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nazarte, who has abused such \Nancient powers must be punished.
Comment: 0,1:17:21.94,1:17:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And has resulted to neighboring \N nations teaming up to fight.
Comment: 0,1:17:35.41,1:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the ministers?
Comment: 0,1:17:37.53,1:17:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They have escaped the palace along with their servants.
Comment: 0,1:17:41.82,1:17:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So they have forsaken me?
Comment: 0,1:17:44.07,1:17:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world!
Comment: 0,1:17:46.90,1:17:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end! Goodbye!
Comment: 0,1:17:51.00,1:17:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, let us hurry.
Comment: 0,1:17:53.13,1:17:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Lady Medmel?
Comment: 0,1:17:56.24,1:17:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What a detestable name!
Comment: 0,1:17:57.74,1:18:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need that thing. \N Leave her along with her mother!
Comment: 0,1:18:51.69,1:18:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia, let's go!
Comment: 0,1:19:28.89,1:19:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,1:19:32.63,1:19:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,1:19:51.44,1:19:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia.
Comment: 0,1:19:54.01,1:19:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Comment: 0,1:19:57.85,1:19:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim?
Comment: 0,1:20:00.50,1:20:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Comment: 0,1:20:02.98,1:20:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You were alive?
Comment: 0,1:20:05.26,1:20:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I...
Comment: 0,1:20:11.33,1:20:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,seeing a ghost?
Comment: 0,1:20:17.89,1:20:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to get you.
Comment: 0,1:20:20.80,1:20:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Comment: 0,1:20:22.51,1:20:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give even more pain
Comment: 0,1:20:25.14,1:20:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to those who have caused you sadness.
Comment: 0,1:20:28.08,1:20:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll start over again.
Comment: 0,1:20:31.00,1:20:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Comment: 0,1:20:35.24,1:20:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet her.
Comment: 0,1:20:37.09,1:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter.
Comment: 0,1:20:40.53,1:20:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Comment: 0,1:20:42.73,1:20:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an unwanted existence \N you were forced to birth, isn't she?
Comment: 0,1:20:46.32,1:20:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I gave birth to her...
Comment: 0,1:20:48.63,1:20:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can forget her!
Comment: 0,1:20:50.39,1:20:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Hibiol doesn't contain your daughter's name.
Comment: 0,1:20:53.84,1:20:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,B-but...
Comment: 0,1:20:56.58,1:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim and everyone died,
Comment: 0,1:20:58.84,1:20:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought.
Comment: 0,1:21:09.80,1:21:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought everything's gone.
Comment: 0,1:21:13.88,1:21:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I've always thought about my daughter.
Comment: 0,1:21:19.75,1:21:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet her.
Comment: 0,1:21:23.94,1:21:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to embrace her.
Comment: 0,1:21:27.18,1:21:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I somehow got through just with these feelings.
Comment: 0,1:21:33.88,1:21:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia.
Comment: 0,1:21:37.77,1:21:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My... Medmel.
Comment: 0,1:21:54.58,1:21:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, Leilia.
Comment: 0,1:21:58.83,1:21:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Together,
Comment: 0,1:22:00.86,1:22:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,let's end it here.
Comment: 0,1:22:05.80,1:22:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim!
Comment: 0,1:22:12.40,1:22:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let
Comment: 0,1:22:18.80,1:22:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone else...
Comment: 0,1:22:23.06,1:22:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,stain our Hibiol
Comment: 0,1:22:25.94,1:22:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,any further.
Comment: 0,1:22:35.29,1:22:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Krim!
Comment: 0,1:22:40.03,1:22:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia!
Comment: 0,1:23:13.41,1:23:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it?
Comment: 0,1:23:16.01,1:23:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia
Comment: 0,1:23:17.72,1:23:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and even Maquia...
Comment: 0,1:23:19.40,1:23:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Comment: 0,1:23:21.86,1:23:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has time moved forward?
Comment: 0,1:24:04.00,1:24:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like that day.
Comment: 0,1:24:33.19,1:24:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel!
Comment: 0,1:24:35.97,1:24:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Division Commander!
Comment: 0,1:24:37.89,1:24:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've received information that an \N Iorph boy and girl was at Baeira's boat.
Comment: 0,1:24:44.74,1:24:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you meet them?
Comment: 0,1:24:49.01,1:24:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,1:24:51.01,1:24:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done. Leave it to us. \N Go to Maqui--
Comment: 0,1:24:54.10,1:24:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight!
Comment: 0,1:24:56.48,1:24:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that loyal to Mezarte?
Comment: 0,1:24:59.23,1:25:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it, right?
Comment: 0,1:25:00.37,1:25:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just looking away from Maquia...
Comment: 0,1:25:02.34,1:25:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not!
Comment: 0,1:25:04.70,1:25:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was true at first.
Comment: 0,1:25:08.16,1:25:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I have Dita.
Comment: 0,1:25:11.35,1:25:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got comrades.
Comment: 0,1:25:13.07,1:25:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And a baby about to be born!
Comment: 0,1:25:15.90,1:25:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mezarte has been the place I belonged to \Never since I got separated from that person.
Comment: 0,1:25:21.64,1:25:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to protect it!
Comment: 0,1:25:43.71,1:25:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Comment: 0,1:25:51.29,1:25:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Comment: 0,1:25:52.05,1:25:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Comment: 0,1:25:53.22,1:25:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Comment: 0,1:25:56.00,1:25:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at this time...
Comment: 0,1:25:57.38,1:25:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Comment: 0,1:26:00.46,1:26:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel's... baby!
Comment: 0,1:26:10.41,1:26:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Comment: 0,1:26:31.73,1:26:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Comment: 0,1:26:37.03,1:26:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita.
Comment: 0,1:26:39.68,1:26:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep at it. Almost there!
Comment: 0,1:26:42.59,1:26:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to meet your baby!
Comment: 0,1:27:04.92,1:27:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, you're doing great!
Comment: 0,1:27:07.66,1:27:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita, just a bit more.
Comment: 0,1:27:11.62,1:27:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Comment: 0,1:27:14.58,1:27:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita!
Comment: 0,1:27:22.37,1:27:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't falter!
Comment: 0,1:27:33.25,1:27:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared...
Comment: 0,1:27:35.91,1:27:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita!
Comment: 0,1:27:36.44,1:27:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, I'm scared!
Comment: 0,1:27:38.40,1:27:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Comment: 0,1:27:40.11,1:27:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita, it's okay...
Comment: 0,1:27:40.98,1:27:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- The baby...
Comment: 0,1:27:42.76,1:27:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the baby!
Comment: 0,1:27:45.69,1:27:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save her.
Comment: 0,1:27:47.96,1:27:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be saved!
Comment: 0,1:27:51.90,1:27:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost dawn! Time to infiltrate!
Comment: 0,1:28:09.88,1:28:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, the baby's been waiting to come out!
Comment: 0,1:28:16.15,1:28:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Ariel are about to \Nbecome mother and father!
Comment: 0,1:28:51.83,1:28:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well, Dita.
Comment: 0,1:28:55.20,1:28:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Comment: 0,1:29:14.25,1:29:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you gonna take him?{\i0}
Comment: 0,1:29:16.84,1:29:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's no toy at all...{\i0}
Comment: 0,1:29:17.86,1:29:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's not a toy.{\i0}
Comment: 0,1:29:19.41,1:29:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's my...
Comment: 0,1:29:21.40,1:29:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hibiol.
Comment: 0,1:29:25.74,1:29:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Comment: 0,1:29:29.03,1:29:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Comment: 0,1:29:41.31,1:29:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel, get back here soon!
Comment: 0,1:29:44.93,1:29:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Comment: 0,1:29:46.80,1:29:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Comment: 0,1:29:52.09,1:29:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've become so cold.
Comment: 0,1:29:56.94,1:29:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:30:06.77,1:30:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home,
Comment: 0,1:30:10.34,1:30:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:30:15.27,1:30:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream...
Comment: 0,1:30:16.93,1:30:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a dream.
Comment: 0,1:30:19.39,1:30:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's snow...
Comment: 0,1:30:22.64,1:30:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not snow. It's ash.
Comment: 0,1:30:36.82,1:30:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your baby with Dita is already born.
Comment: 0,1:30:43.35,1:30:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't overexert yourself.
Comment: 0,1:30:45.00,1:30:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright. They're waiting for you.
Comment: 0,1:30:48.37,1:30:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two have been waiting for you.
Comment: 0,1:30:53.76,1:30:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how you
Comment: 0,1:30:56.24,1:30:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,got born from your mother then.
Comment: 0,1:31:04.56,1:31:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother hugged you so tightly.
Comment: 0,1:31:12.18,1:31:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Her fingers were hardened.
Comment: 0,1:31:15.90,1:31:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get you off easily.
Comment: 0,1:31:18.97,1:31:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And one finger after another...
Comment: 0,1:31:21.95,1:31:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Comment: 0,1:31:22.87,1:31:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Comment: 0,1:31:25.15,1:31:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,never became your mother.
Comment: 0,1:31:28.34,1:31:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough already!
Comment: 0,1:31:31.80,1:31:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught me all:
Comment: 0,1:31:34.28,1:31:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,kindness,
Comment: 0,1:31:35.88,1:31:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,strength,
Comment: 0,1:31:37.50,1:31:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,desparation,
Comment: 0,1:31:39.70,1:31:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the feeling of loving someone...
Comment: 0,1:31:47.88,1:31:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking of you
Comment: 0,1:31:50.89,1:31:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,was the same as thinking about me.
Comment: 0,1:31:55.86,1:31:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When I met you,
Comment: 0,1:31:58.32,1:32:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'll cry with me,
Comment: 0,1:32:03.30,1:32:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that you're my Hibiol.
Comment: 0,1:32:09.11,1:32:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you,
Comment: 0,1:32:11.35,1:32:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,all the sad and painful things...
Comment: 0,1:32:16.02,1:32:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,they all subside.
Comment: 0,1:32:19.28,1:32:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, I...
Comment: 0,1:32:22.05,1:32:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,have from you...
Comment: 0,1:32:24.75,1:32:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't a liar, Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:32:28.41,1:32:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept your promise.
Comment: 0,1:32:32.84,1:32:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You have always protected me.
Comment: 0,1:32:38.16,1:32:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When we went apart, and I became alone,
Comment: 0,1:32:41.84,1:32:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose sight of myself.
Comment: 0,1:32:45.60,1:32:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I remember you,
Comment: 0,1:32:49.75,1:32:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I become myself.
Comment: 0,1:32:52.70,1:32:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call me, I don't care if it isn't "Mom".
Comment: 0,1:32:58.76,1:33:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what name it is,
Comment: 0,1:33:00.82,1:33:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that name will surely be mine.
Comment: 0,1:33:06.40,1:33:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who has weaved me... was you.
Comment: 0,1:33:22.11,1:33:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia!
Comment: 0,1:33:27.51,1:33:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lang!
Comment: 0,1:33:29.22,1:33:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take Ariel?
Comment: 0,1:33:33.06,1:33:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To where Dita and their baby is.
Comment: 0,1:33:36.39,1:33:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To where Ariel belongs.
Comment: 0,1:33:50.42,1:33:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go...
Comment: 0,1:33:59.79,1:34:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Comment: 0,1:34:01.70,1:34:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Comment: 0,1:35:10.14,1:35:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time we descend, Lady Medmel.
Comment: 0,1:35:13.54,1:35:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Father and the others?
Comment: 0,1:35:19.12,1:35:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. That's okay.
Comment: 0,1:35:23.33,1:35:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go down,
Comment: 0,1:35:25.05,1:35:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,a totally different life awaits me.
Comment: 0,1:35:29.20,1:35:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, I...
Comment: 0,1:35:48.74,1:35:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Comment: 0,1:35:53.24,1:35:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia...
Comment: 0,1:36:00.41,1:36:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Comment: 0,1:36:02.41,1:36:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My... dear mother...
Comment: 0,1:36:10.37,1:36:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Leilia, an Iorphian.
Comment: 0,1:36:14.11,1:36:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomboyish and always bouncing back,
Comment: 0,1:36:20.87,1:36:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,a strong willed woman,
Comment: 0,1:36:22.83,1:36:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and... free.
Comment: 0,1:36:27.44,1:36:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Leilia, fly!
Comment: 0,1:36:43.64,1:36:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I... can fly!
Comment: 0,1:36:48.75,1:36:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Comment: 0,1:36:49.24,1:36:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear mother!
Comment: 0,1:37:08.80,1:37:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Maquia.
Comment: 0,1:37:12.25,1:37:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Comment: 0,1:37:14.45,1:37:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fly too.
Comment: 0,1:37:22.74,1:37:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Comment: 0,1:37:24.50,1:37:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about me!
Comment: 0,1:37:26.77,1:37:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will also forget!
Comment: 0,1:37:28.93,1:37:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The days I spent in the castle, about this morning,
Comment: 0,1:37:31.93,1:37:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't write in the Hibiol!
Comment: 0,1:37:33.96,1:37:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear mother...
Comment: 0,1:37:35.53,1:37:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I will forget in my long, long memories.
Comment: 0,1:37:40.12,1:37:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be forgotten.
Comment: 0,1:37:42.98,1:37:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Comment: 0,1:37:44.58,1:37:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It will just be like a seam!
Comment: 0,1:37:51.59,1:37:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Say,
Comment: 0,1:37:52.79,1:37:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Comment: 0,1:37:53.79,1:37:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear mother's a very beautiful person.
Comment: 0,1:38:01.94,1:38:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Medmel.
Comment: 0,1:38:06.03,1:38:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Renato!
Comment: 0,1:38:12.86,1:38:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Leilia...
Comment: 0,1:38:16.35,1:38:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We need no Renato.
Comment: 0,1:38:18.64,1:38:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We need no Iorph.
Comment: 0,1:38:20.69,1:38:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A destiny where beings of old are disappearing.
Comment: 0,1:38:24.24,1:38:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is so,
Comment: 0,1:38:25.81,1:38:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,we let them do what they desire at the end.
Comment: 0,1:38:34.34,1:38:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Leilia.
Comment: 0,1:38:41.29,1:38:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You won't ever forget.
Comment: 0,1:38:56.59,1:38:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Comment: 0,1:38:59.93,1:39:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts so much.
Comment: 0,1:39:04.43,1:39:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't ever forget...
Comment: 0,1:39:07.94,1:39:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,such a beautiful world.
Comment: 0,1:39:42.80,1:39:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Comment: 0,1:39:46.31,1:39:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You came back...
Comment: 0,1:39:49.34,1:39:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I would.
Comment: 0,1:40:05.39,1:40:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so soft, it's scary...
Comment: 0,1:40:13.62,1:40:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta decide on her name.
Comment: 0,1:40:18.15,1:40:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dita?
Comment: 0,1:40:19.94,1:40:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Comment: 0,1:40:22.63,1:40:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were kids,
Comment: 0,1:40:25.39,1:40:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Liking your mother is weird"...
Comment: 0,1:40:30.89,1:40:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,was something I said.
Comment: 0,1:40:33.84,1:40:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't weird.
Comment: 0,1:40:36.41,1:40:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother is too beautiful
Comment: 0,1:40:41.03,1:40:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and kind
Comment: 0,1:40:44.13,1:40:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Comment: 0,1:40:49.05,1:40:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this child--
Comment: 0,1:40:51.38,1:40:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Comment: 0,1:40:53.68,1:40:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I do too...
Comment: 0,1:40:55.94,1:41:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have always been jealous of your mother...
Comment: 0,1:41:04.26,1:41:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I, who was raised by my \N mom, will love you.
Comment: 0,1:41:10.12,1:41:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid will surely have her own faithful encounter.
Comment: 0,1:41:13.70,1:41:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, let's raise her.
Comment: 0,1:41:16.78,1:41:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and you, the two of us.
Comment: 0,1:41:20.41,1:41:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This child that will love someone from now on.
Comment: 0,1:41:30.03,1:41:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Clan of Partings
Comment: 0,1:41:33.16,1:41:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,sees off many departures,
Comment: 0,1:41:36.21,1:41:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,sees off things that change,
Comment: 0,1:41:39.33,1:41:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,time for them continues without end.
Comment: 0,1:41:44.54,1:41:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is why, they'll have encounters,
Comment: 0,1:41:49.97,1:41:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,will meet,
Comment: 0,1:41:52.12,1:41:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and will weave.
Comment: 0,1:42:08.56,1:42:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day.
Comment: 0,1:42:13.58,1:42:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take me to your grandpa?
Comment: 0,1:42:17.52,1:42:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa?
Comment: 0,1:42:18.77,1:42:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lily!
Comment: 0,1:42:20.45,1:42:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good! This is where you've been?
Comment: 0,1:42:25.16,1:42:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Comment: 0,1:42:30.06,1:42:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother passed away three years ago.
Comment: 0,1:42:33.29,1:42:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They were such a loving couple.
Comment: 0,1:42:35.84,1:42:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Mezarte has fallen,
Comment: 0,1:42:37.86,1:42:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,they came back here thanks to Lang's guidance.
Comment: 0,1:42:41.72,1:42:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They had hard times, but I \Nthink they lived a happy life.
Comment: 0,1:42:52.58,1:42:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Comment: 0,1:42:54.06,1:42:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They've talked a lot about you.
Comment: 0,1:42:57.39,1:42:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them, happily.
Comment: 0,1:43:00.69,1:43:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you made it in time.
Comment: 0,1:43:03.27,1:43:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My father is already...
Comment: 0,1:43:35.63,1:43:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back,
Comment: 0,1:43:37.16,1:43:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:43:48.65,1:43:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:43:55.40,1:43:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lived
Comment: 0,1:44:00.29,1:44:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,your life to the fullest, didn't you?
Comment: 0,1:44:04.46,1:44:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:44:11.13,1:44:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't cry.
Comment: 0,1:44:13.14,1:44:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised... after all.
Comment: 0,1:44:29.75,1:44:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome... home.
Comment: 0,1:44:42.38,1:44:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Comment: 0,1:45:32.17,1:45:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:45:36.26,1:45:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back before dinner.
Comment: 0,1:45:46.31,1:45:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Have these!
Comment: 0,1:45:48.13,1:45:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Comment: 0,1:46:10.04,1:46:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mom! Mom!
Comment: 0,1:46:12.80,1:46:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Welcome back!
Comment: 0,1:46:14.14,1:46:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Listen!
Comment: 0,1:46:15.12,1:46:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Listen!
Comment: 0,1:46:15.77,1:46:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I'm back!
Comment: 0,1:46:17.62,1:46:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Good morning!
Comment: 0,1:46:19.57,1:46:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}You got fooled!
Comment: 0,1:46:20.78,1:46:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}You thought that was my shed skin, didn't you?
Comment: 0,1:46:22.82,1:46:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Where was I born?
Comment: 0,1:46:24.33,1:46:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}The wiggly bugs are here!
Comment: 0,1:46:26.48,1:46:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}She laughed!
Comment: 0,1:46:28.82,1:46:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mama is different from others, they say.
Comment: 0,1:46:30.50,1:46:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mom, take a look!
Comment: 0,1:46:31.39,1:46:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Come on!
Comment: 0,1:46:32.62,1:46:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mom, why?
Comment: 0,1:46:35.22,1:46:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}You're not like Mom when you're here!
Comment: 0,1:46:37.74,1:46:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Don't make Mom cry!
Comment: 0,1:46:40.41,1:46:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I'm okay as long as Mom is with me!
Comment: 0,1:46:42.56,1:46:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I'll protect you, Mom!
Comment: 0,1:46:43.89,1:46:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mom...
Comment: 0,1:46:45.00,1:46:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mom...
Comment: 0,1:46:45.55,1:46:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mom...
Comment: 0,1:46:46.25,1:46:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Hey,
Comment: 0,1:46:47.04,1:46:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}It's okay. I'll do it myself
Comment: 0,1:46:48.75,1:46:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I'll be going now.
Comment: 0,1:46:49.42,1:46:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}It's going to be okay.
Comment: 0,1:46:50.76,1:46:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Wait.
Comment: 0,1:46:52.07,1:46:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I know that.
Comment: 0,1:46:52.91,1:46:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}What the hell.
Comment: 0,1:46:53.70,1:46:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}No, it's okay.
Comment: 0,1:46:54.56,1:46:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I've grown to hate it.
Comment: 0,1:46:55.65,1:46:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I'm back.
Comment: 0,1:46:56.18,1:46:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I don't think of you as my mother.
Comment: 0,1:46:58.68,1:47:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Aah, I don't know!
Comment: 0,1:47:00.40,1:47:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I wanted to protect her.
Comment: 0,1:47:01.64,1:47:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I couldn't protect her.
Comment: 0,1:47:02.58,1:47:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I can't... protect her by myself!
Comment: 0,1:47:05.15,1:47:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Why is that person... treating me carefully?
Comment: 0,1:47:10.28,1:47:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}You taught me.
Comment: 0,1:47:12.28,1:47:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Please don't go!
Comment: 0,1:47:13.85,1:47:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mom!
Comment: 0,1:47:15.65,1:47:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel, I'm sorry.
Comment: 0,1:47:18.49,1:47:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}Mom?
Comment: 0,1:47:20.47,1:47:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Comment: 0,1:47:22.31,1:47:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}I won't cry anymore!
Comment: 0,1:47:24.33,1:47:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}Because I'm a mother!
Comment: 0,1:47:27.27,1:47:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}That's a promise.
Comment: 0,1:47:29.63,1:47:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom's gonna
Comment: 0,1:47:30.66,1:47:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,break her promise...
Comment: 0,1:47:39.91,1:47:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}Mom!
Comment: 0,1:47:45.97,1:47:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}I love you, Mom!
Comment: 0,1:47:50.05,1:47:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}I love you!
Comment: 0,1:48:03.95,1:48:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}Ariel...
Comment: 0,1:48:11.48,1:48:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\1a&H1A&\fad(200,200)}Ariel...
Comment: 0,1:48:32.88,1:48:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Done already?
Comment: 0,1:48:35.14,1:48:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't end.
Comment: 0,1:48:36.90,1:48:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm alive,
Comment: 0,1:48:39.45,1:48:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ariel's Hibiol continues on.
Comment: 0,1:48:45.38,1:48:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't laugh at it!
Comment: 0,1:48:47.26,1:48:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Elder will surely laugh at your face too!
Comment: 0,1:48:57.71,1:48:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Will surely laugh at you
Comment: 0,1:48:59.41,1:49:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,for showing her a parting
Comment: 0,1:49:01.64,1:49:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that doesn't only have pain.
Comment: 0,1:49:08.22,1:49:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop in. Let's go.
Comment: 0,1:49:10.06,1:49:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A new parting is for another meeting.
Comment: 0,1:49:21.78,1:49:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder,
Comment: 0,1:49:24.70,1:49:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that I loved Ariel.
Comment: 0,1:49:33.37,1:49:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I loved.
Comment: 0,1:49:47.21,1:49:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}ちっぽけな星よ
Comment: 0,1:49:54.76,1:50:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}まわり続けて...
Comment: 0,1:50:01.81,1:50:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}あふれそうに輝いて
Comment: 0,1:50:09.33,1:50:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}流れて行く
Comment: 0,1:50:13.04,1:50:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}綺麗なままで
Comment: 0,1:50:44.14,1:50:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}歩き出す 愛を連れて
Comment: 0,1:50:52.98,1:50:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}奏でるように
Comment: 0,1:50:59.06,1:51:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}信じてる どんな形でも
Comment: 0,1:51:09.97,1:51:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}太陽は昇るから きっと
Comment: 0,1:51:34.83,1:51:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}ちっぽけな星よ
Comment: 0,1:51:42.32,1:51:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}落ちた涙は
Comment: 0,1:51:49.36,1:51:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}あふれそうな優しさを
Comment: 0,1:51:56.83,1:52:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}見せてくれる
Comment: 0,1:52:00.61,1:52:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}もう一度 笑って
Comment: 0,1:52:42.63,1:52:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}その胸の中には何があるの？
Comment: 0,1:53:01.54,1:53:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}歩き出す 愛になって
Comment: 0,1:53:10.43,1:53:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}光の中へ
Comment: 0,1:53:16.62,1:53:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}大丈夫 どんな未来でも
Comment: 0,1:53:27.36,1:53:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}太陽は昇るから きっと
Comment: 0,1:49:47.21,1:49:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}chippoke na hoshi yo
Comment: 0,1:49:54.76,1:50:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}mawari tsuzukete...
Comment: 0,1:50:01.81,1:50:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}afuresou ni kagayaite
Comment: 0,1:50:09.33,1:50:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}nagarete yuku
Comment: 0,1:50:13.04,1:50:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}kirei na mama de
Comment: 0,1:50:44.14,1:50:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}arukidasu ai wo tsurete
Comment: 0,1:50:52.98,1:50:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}kanaderu you ni
Comment: 0,1:50:59.06,1:51:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}shinjiru donna katachi demo
Comment: 0,1:51:09.97,1:51:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}taiyou wa noboru kara kitto
Comment: 0,1:51:34.83,1:51:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}chippoke na hoshi yo
Comment: 0,1:51:42.32,1:51:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}ochita namida wa
Comment: 0,1:51:49.36,1:51:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}afuresou na yasashisa wo
Comment: 0,1:51:56.83,1:52:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}misete kureru
Comment: 0,1:52:00.61,1:52:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}mou ichidou waratte
Comment: 0,1:52:42.63,1:52:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}sono mune no naka ni wa nani ga aru no?
Comment: 0,1:53:01.54,1:53:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}arukidasu ai ni natte
Comment: 0,1:53:10.43,1:53:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}hikari no naka e
Comment: 0,1:53:16.62,1:53:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}daijoubu donna mirai demo
Comment: 0,1:53:27.36,1:53:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}taiyou wa noboru kara kitto
Comment: 0,1:49:47.21,1:49:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}Oh little stars,
Comment: 0,1:49:54.76,1:50:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}keep on revolving
Comment: 0,1:50:01.81,1:50:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}overflowing with brightness
Comment: 0,1:50:09.33,1:50:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}you continue to flow
Comment: 0,1:50:13.04,1:50:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}as beautiful as you are
Comment: 0,1:50:44.14,1:50:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}We start to walk, \Ntaking in our love
Comment: 0,1:50:52.98,1:50:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}like playing a melody
Comment: 0,1:50:59.06,1:51:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}I'll believe, in any shape or form
Comment: 0,1:51:09.97,1:51:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}the sun will rise for sure
Comment: 0,1:51:34.83,1:51:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}Oh little stars,
Comment: 0,1:51:42.32,1:51:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}your fallen tears
Comment: 0,1:51:49.36,1:51:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}are showing me
Comment: 0,1:51:56.83,1:52:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}your overflowing kindness
Comment: 0,1:52:00.61,1:52:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}smile once again
Comment: 0,1:52:42.63,1:52:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}What lies inside your heart?
Comment: 0,1:53:01.54,1:53:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}We start to walk, becoming love
Comment: 0,1:53:10.43,1:53:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}towards the light
Comment: 0,1:53:16.62,1:53:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}no matter what future it may bring
Comment: 0,1:53:27.36,1:53:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the sun will rise for sure.
