Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.14,1:50:52.64,Viator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}Arukidasu ai wo tsurete
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.98,1:50:58.96,Viator,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\be3}Kanaderu you ni
